    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "MOVEHOME ESTATE AGENTS ... are proud to offer a fantastic development opportunity to the New Year market with a warehouse site spanning approx. 197 m² / 2,120.49 sq. ft² just off the central and established Henrietta Street in the very heart of Dublin 1. This lane is easily accessed off the renowned Henrietta Street and minutes from Capel Street, Henry Street and The IFSC. Henrietta Lane is accessed just off Bolton Street, enjoying an enviable location with the city on your doorstep. Tucked away from the hustle and bustle, while still enjoying every conceivable amenity within close proximity and walking distance.\r\n\r\nThis site is located to the very back of the property 4 Henrietta Street and which originally hosted stables and outhouses for the domestic staff in the 18th & 19th century's, was accessed from a tunnel under the garden. This 197sq. mtr. site is another development opportunity and subject to planning, could be developed for apartments, or a mews, as it is accessed directly from large gates onto Henrietta Lane. \r\n\r\nLocal amenities in the area include The Mater Hospital, Croke Park and Henry Street, together with a range of hotels, shops, bars and restaurants. Healy Street is well serviced by public transport including a host of Dublin Bus Routes and the nearby cross city Luas Line, access to all areas of the City. Surrounding areas for commuters could not be easier with the M50 and major road networks easily accessible. This popular development opportunity is ideally located within walking distance to all the city has to offer thanks to its central location. There are many services and amenities on your doorstep such as Trinity College Dublin, TU Dublin, and the Royal College of Surgeons Ireland which are all within walking distance. There is a wide selection of fine restaurants and cafes and bars in the vicinity and the area is excellently serviced by regular bus routes and a cross city LUAS stop is located across the road. This property is sure to appeal to a wide variety of developers and early viewing is advised.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is essential to appreciate all this wonderful development opportunity has to offer and can be arranged with MOVEHOME ESTATE AGENTS ... on 01-8844690"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Storage 1:\r\n2.65m x 1.60m \r\n\r\nStorage 2: \r\n2.65m x 5.46m \r\n\r\nStorage 3: \r\n4.08m x 7.27m \r\n\r\nStorage 4:\r\n3.20m x 4.08m\r\n\r\nStorage 5:\r\n5.33m x 1.89m \r\n\r\nStorage 6: \r\n5.89m x 21.00m \r\n\r\nRoom 1:\r\n2.82m x 3.17m\r\n\r\nRoom 2: \r\n2.82m x 1.41m\r\n\r\n** Overall area approx. 197 sq. mtrs / 2120 sq. ft **\r\n**Please note all measurements and floor plans are approximate and provided for guidance only**\r\n\r\nAll information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to ourselves. While every care is taken in preparing particulars the firm do not hold themselves responsible for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get a professional opinion on any concern they may have."
